#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/analytics/README.component.html:7
msgid "The random browser UUID is stored in localStorage; the current session ID is stored in sessionStorage. Reloads reuse the session; 30 minutes without recorded activity starts a new one. Navigation completions record page views. Basic pointer/keyboard activity updates are throttled to once per minute. No fingerprinting or user-agent parsing is performed; device/browser/OS fields are reserved and nullable. Authenticated user IDs are taken from verified Taon session tokens, never from the collection payload."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/analytics/README.component.html:14
msgid "Overview shows all-time visitor, session and page-view counts. Visitors uses the standard Taon datatable. Pages View, Events and Traffic Sources are placeholders; their underlying data can be extended later."
msgstr ""

